3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM STD 4.4.2 l.1450-1454, 13.5.4, 9.2.4.1 l.4670-4677: pictures with an underline in the name receive an array.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL PICTURE BAR_CHART
20 PICTURE MI_PIC(V())
30 PRINT V(1)
